      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mornington%2C_Victoria",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Grand Hotel, opened in 1892 as an alcohol‑free Grand Coffee Palace, was designed by Melbourne architect William Pitt.",
